Wesley D. Bay, P.E., Deputy City Engineer
DATE:
May 9th, 2022
SUBJECT:
Professional Service Agreement between the City of Cheyenne and BenchMark
Engineers, PC, for Christensen Road Design Modifications.
Please find the attached Professional Service Agreement between the City and BenchMark
Engineers for engineering design services on Christensen Road for the City of Cheyenne.
Engineering Staff evaluates fee proposals for engineering services based on time and material
estimates for the specific project.
Those costs are readily tracked and verified during
designlreview operations and the City only pays for the actual time expended. We believe this
agreement will provide the required services to complete needed upgrades to Christensen Road.
Design services will include the addition of lighting along the northern end of the newly
constructed Christensen corridor, drainage improvements, signage upgrades, right-of-way platting,
and construction administration when the improvements are implemented. City finding for these
services will come from 6th Penny sales tax. The total professional services will be a cost not-to
exceed $73,525.00. We respectfully request your approval ofthis professional services agreement.
